  "excerpt": "Refund &amp; Returns Policy This policy explains how Youth Face handles return, refund and order-issue requests. Return Eligibility Returns or refunds for damaged, defective, or incorrect products may be requested within 7 days from the date of delivery, subject to applicable return conditions. Non-Returnable Products Return eligibility depends on the product condition and the applicable&hellip;",
  "content": "<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"className\":\"is-style-section-1\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-section-1\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size,1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Refund &amp; Returns Policy</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">This policy explains how Youth Face handles return, refund and order-issue requests.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"className\":\"is-style-section-2\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-section-2\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size,900px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Return Eligibility</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Returns or refunds for damaged, defective, or incorrect products may be requested within 7 days from the date of delivery, subject to applicable return conditions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion {\"autoclose\":true,\"headingLevel\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion\">\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<!-- wp:accordion-heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Non-Returnable Products</span></button></h2>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Return eligibility depends on the product condition and the applicable policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<!-- wp:accordion-heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Damaged, Defective or Incorrect Orders</span></button></h2>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect, please contact Youth Face promptly after delivery. Provide your order details and an explanation of the issue. Photos may be requested where needed to review the issue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<!-- wp:accordion-heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How to Request a Return</span></button></h2>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To request a return, contact Youth Face through the <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact page</a> or customer support, provide your order details, explain the issue, and follow the instructions provided by Youth Face.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<!-- wp:accordion-heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Refunds</span></button></h2>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Refund requests are reviewed and processed in line with the applicable policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Customer Support</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For help with an order or a policy question, contact Youth Face. Youth Face is a brand operated by Beauty Mart.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Beauty Mart<br>Azad Nagar, 4th Cross, Bhatkal, Karnataka, India<br>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+919980881230\">+91 99808 81230</a><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:mdneehal@gmail.com\">mdneehal@gmail.com</a><br>WhatsApp: <a href=\"tel:+919980881230\">+91 99808 81230</a><br>Call: <a href=\"tel:+919980881230\">+91 99808 81230</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Us</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e5e0d8;border-radius:12px;background:#faf6f2;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Related policies and help</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.8;color:#444;\"><a href=\"/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href=\"/terms-conditions/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Terms and Conditions</a> &middot; <a href=\"/shipping-delivery/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a> &middot; <a href=\"/security/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Security</a> &middot; <a href=\"/contact/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Contact</a> &middot; <a href=\"/sitemap/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">HTML sitemap</a></p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->"
